{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_2001_p", "source_sha256": "dedf054bac5666a9ba4668eccf110c1ede56330abfc82bb3d94833afeb908c80", "ja": "お疲れ様、茜。\n栄養ドリンクのCMの撮影、うまくいったな。", "zh": "辛苦了，茜。\n营养饮料的广告拍摄得很顺利呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_2002_023aka", "source_sha256": "43d904a2833b47ea58037defc2ea830a71639aefb87380e0741528b21ff2d2eb", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃんも、お疲れさまー！\nさっきスタッフちゃんに、いいモノもらってきたんだ。", "zh": "小{$P$}也辛苦了──！\n刚才小工作人员给了小茜好东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_2003_023aka", "source_sha256": "ce244347b475d15df1bdd125fcd46c89d4811d28891fc3e0d6bc67c084202afc", "ja": "じゃん！　CMに使った栄養ドリンク！\n{$P$}ちゃんにあげるー♪", "zh": "锵！拍广告用的营养饮料！\n给小{$P$}──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_2004_023aka", "source_sha256": "85b2ec3ebb75c52a4deaf1524031776fdaa3aa28401510bc3e6acb5ec00dc3f3", "ja": "日ごろ茜ちゃんのキビシー指導に耐えて頑張ってる\n{$P$}ちゃんに、ご褒美だよ！", "zh": "因为你平时努力熬过小茜严厉的指导，\n这是给小{$P$}的奖励！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_2005_p", "source_sha256": "933abd5df0758915ca7f32804956d2ca54efdfb6f53a1370ba1189f51840ad58", "ja": "いや、指導してるのはこっちなんだが……。\nでもこの栄養ドリンクは、ありがたくもらっておくよ。", "zh": "不，指导的人是我才对……\n不过这瓶营养饮料，我就不客气地收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
